<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you very much for submitting your application and prescreening materials to the Herberger Institute School of Music at Arizona State University. We regret to inform you that you have not been selected for further consideration for admission to the School of Music.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">You are welcome to apply again for a future semester. We archive recommendation letters and transcripts for one year after the application date, so if you apply for admission for 2017, you will not need to resubmit those materials. However, you will need to follow all other application procedures posted <a href="http://music.asu.edu/admissions">here</a>. &nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in the Herberger Institute School of Music. We wish you well in your academic endeavors.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Heather Landes, Ph.D.</font></div><div><font face="arial">Director, School of Music</font></div><div><span style="font-family: arial;"><font color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></span></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>